SECTION 2 -- the prediction: theta = 1 valid where BCT's WEIGHTS DO NOT EXIST
   At predictor tail index < 2, E||X||^2 = inf, so tr V_0 = sigma^2 E||X||^2
   is infinite and BCT's limit law has no weights.  tr V_1 = sigma^2 is finite.
   Theorem 6' never uses Ahat -> A, so theta = 1 should hold its level anyway.
============================================================================================
