    beta itself     6.0 |     1.000     1.000     1.000     1.000     1.000

   -> read across each row: this is the price of theta, in power, at a
      tail index where BOTH tests are valid.  A theta that wins on the
      leading direction and loses on the trailing one is trading, not
      dominating, and the paper must say which.

